      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790718119391,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Turn OFF both sliders above\n• Set a fixed value = former max\n  (nodes, then executors)\n• Every session grabs the full\n  ceiling from the first second\n• Trade-off: less headroom left\n  for other concurrent sessions",
      "fontSize": 15.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Turn OFF both sliders above\n• Set a fixed value = former max\n  (nodes, then executors)\n• Every session grabs the full\n  ceiling from the first second\n• Trade-off: less headroom left\n  for other concurrent sessions",
