      "text": "VCores/session =\n  node size (vCores/node) × node count\n\n• Bigger cluster size → fewer\n  concurrent sessions fit the budget\n• Smaller size + higher max cluster\n  count → more concurrent users",
      "fontSize": 15.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "VCores/session =\n  node size (vCores/node) × node count\n\n• Bigger cluster size → fewer\n  concurrent sessions fit the budget\n• Smaller size + higher max cluster\n  count → more concurrent users",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
