      "updated": 1790719070514,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Node Sizes & Worked Examples: How Sessions Consume Available Nodes\nPool = a configuration template (node size + scaling rules). Cluster = the compute Fabric provisions from it for ONE session.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Node Sizes & Worked Examples: How Sessions Consume Available Nodes\nPool = a configuration template (node size + scaling rules). Cluster = the compute Fabric provisions from it for ONE session.",
