      "text": "Size       vCores    Memory\nSmall        4        32 GB\nMedium     8        64 GB\nLarge       16       128 GB\nX-Large    32       256 GB\nXX-Large   64       512 GB\n\n• Fabric Spark uses the Memory Optimized\nnode family only",
