    {
      "id": "qWibY6PFcv7DJzk3i8ju6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 938,
      "y": 1721.3999999999999,
      "width": 295.12,
      "height": 213.125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "9wg1QlRRLiiRejeKx0gbV-g"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 923055652,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2119161123,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790719070514,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Cluster size: 4 nodes (Medium)\nMax cluster count: 5\n\nWarm footprint = 4 × 5 nodes\n× 8 vCores = 160 VCores\nreserved for the whole schedule\nwindow — whether used or not\n\nOn an F64 (128 base / 384 burst):\nexceeds base — relies on burst,\nleaves less room for everyone else",
      "fontSize": 15.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Cluster size: 4 nodes (Medium)\nMax cluster count: 5\n\nWarm footprint = 4 × 5 nodes\n× 8 vCores = 160 VCores\nreserved for the whole schedule\nwindow — whether used or not\n\nOn an F64 (128 base / 384 burst):\nexceeds base — relies on burst,\nleaves less room for everyone else",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
