      "updated": 1790732239087,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The Capacity-Level Cap (a 2nd ceiling)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The Capacity-Level Cap (a 2nd ceiling)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ul4EAF6VZujLwd0XuA1lM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1296,
      "y": 2520,
      "width": 324.8,
      "height": 235.625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "YELZc4ZSAntNkOQgp5Ah4-g"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1215006468,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1590500759,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790732239087,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Even if a pool ALLOWS more nodes, a\ncapacity admin can cap what any ONE\njob can actually use:\n\nAdmin portal → Capacity settings →\nData Engineering/Science → Spark\nCompute → Disable job-level bursting\n\n• Enabled (default): one job can use\n  up to the full burst ceiling (3× base)\n• Disabled: one job is capped at the\n  BASE SKU VCores — protects other\n  concurrent jobs sharing the capacity",
      "fontSize": 14.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Even if a pool ALLOWS more nodes, a\ncapacity admin can cap what any ONE\njob can actually use:\n\nAdmin portal → Capacity settings →\nData Engineering/Science → Spark\nCompute → Disable job-level bursting\n\n• Enabled (default): one job can use\n  up to the full burst ceiling (3× base)\n• Disabled: one job is capped at the\n  BASE SKU VCores — protects other\n  concurrent jobs sharing the capacity",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
