    {
      "id": "rRiULSgYQqcAyvt1JGQ85",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 676,
      "y": 3411.2,
      "width": 413.28000000000003,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "Ud4t32oMJgiapM3J8yu7d-g"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1093234399,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 284031060,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790732239087,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Its Own Limit — No Bursting, No Smoothing",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Its Own Limit — No Bursting, No Smoothing",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "FA1pJsYTRkfNt3Uo9zgzj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 676,
      "y": 3440,
      "width": 284.20000000000005,
      "height": 235.625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "Ud4t32oMJgiapM3J8yu7d-g"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1893894866,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 446126610,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790732239087,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Admin sets a Maximum Capacity\n  Unit (CU) limit — its own\n  independent quota\n• Total Spark VCores = 2 × that max\n  CU (same 1 CU = 2 VCores rule,\n  on a completely separate pool of\n  capacity from your main SKU)\n• Does NOT burst and does NOT use\n  smoothing — whatever you set is\n  the hard ceiling, always\n• At the CU limit: interactive jobs\n  throttle, background jobs queue\n  (queue size = the CU limit)",
      "fontSize": 14.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Admin sets a Maximum Capacity\n  Unit (CU) limit — its own\n  independent quota\n• Total Spark VCores = 2 × that max\n  CU (same 1 CU = 2 VCores rule,\n  on a completely separate pool of\n  capacity from your main SKU)\n• Does NOT burst and does NOT use\n  smoothing — whatever you set is\n  the hard ceiling, always\n• At the CU limit: interactive jobs\n  throttle, background jobs queue\n  (queue size = the CU limit)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8i0LSGjt5yiHX9E2mEsjZ",
