    },
    {
      "id": "HH1gYjL3j9QP4e4IZR7Hk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4008.5398633352697,
      "y": 1860.2342354890006,
      "width": 374.3495327906483,
      "height": 145,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "PniED_0Ee8yMpDO2iYdeL"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bgy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1669800761,
      "version": 694,
      "versionNonce": 1237343719,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791218178820,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Every Fabric capacity can burst up to 3× its\npurchased Spark vCores\n• Bursting speeds up EXECUTION — a job finishes\nfaster by borrowing extra compute; it doesn't\nchange what you're billed for the capacity\n• Pool configuration sets the ceiling: a job can only\nuse as many vCores as its pool's node size × max\nnode count allows",
      "fontSize": 14.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Every Fabric capacity can burst up to 3× its purchased Spark vCores\n• Bursting speeds up EXECUTION — a job finishes faster by borrowing extra compute; it doesn't change what you're billed for the capacity\n• Pool configuration sets the ceiling: a job can only use as many vCores as its pool's node size × max node count allows",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
