      "updated": 1791218928906,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Admin sets node size, autoscale range, and dynamic\nexecutor allocation\n• No schedule; cold start (~3-5 mins)\n• Full control for workload-specific tuning",
      "fontSize": 15.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Admin sets node size, autoscale range, and dynamic executor allocation\n• No schedule; cold start (~3-5 mins)\n• Full control for workload-specific tuning",
