      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791218914528,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Prehydrated clusters — ~5s starts (with Full mode environment libraries)\n• Runs on a schedule\n• Cluster size × Max cluster count =  total warm VCore footprint\n• Idle timeout + Reactivation interval control in-window elasticity",
      "fontSize": 15.5,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Prehydrated clusters — ~5s starts (with Full mode environment libraries)\n• Runs on a schedule\n• Cluster size × Max cluster count =  total warm VCore footprint\n• Idle timeout + Reactivation interval control in-window elasticity",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
